    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "common_0230_rival_00b",
      "hash64": "A061F0FFA7BAFC72",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]！\\n歡迎來到葡萄學院！[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "common_0230_rival_01",
      "hash64": "7FE30373EF51A657",
      "text": "這裡就是學校的\\n入口大廳喔～！[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "common_0230_rival_02",
      "hash64": "7FE30473EF51A80A",
      "text": "只要在這裡的櫃台登記\\n就可以選修各種課，\\r\\n而且這裡也通往校內的各種設施呢！[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "common_0230_rival_03",
      "hash64": "7FE30573EF51A9BD",
      "text": "這個空間根本就是大得可以用來對戰，\\n可是在入口的寶可夢對戰\\r\\n是違反校規的……[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "common_0230_head_teacher_01",
      "hash64": "C0DB5822B31FB3B4",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]同學、妮莫同學。[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "common_0230_head_teacher_02",
      "hash64": "C0DB5B22B31FB8CD",
      "text": "在第一次上學的路上\\n一切都好嗎？[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "common_0230_select_01",
      "hash64": "0554FE5451260E41",
      "text": "很開心！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "common_0230_select_02",
      "hash64": "0554FB5451260928",
      "text": "好不容易！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "common_0230_head_teacher_02a",
      "hash64": "D47487F65EE6CC44",
      "text": "也許是多虧有妮莫同學陪著[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳吧。\\n這讓我這個校長也很驕傲。[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "common_0230_head_teacher_02b",
      "hash64": "D4748AF65EE6D15D",
      "text": "哎呀哎呀？\\n看來是一場大冒險呢。[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "common_0230_head_teacher_03",
      "hash64": "C0DB5A22B31FB71A",
      "text": "真不愧是冠軍級的訓練家，\\n真不愧是學生會長。\\r\\n謝謝妳幫忙帶路。[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "common_0230_rival_04",
      "hash64": "7FE2FE73EF519DD8",
      "text": "我們是朋友，應該的！\\n對吧～？[VAR 0x0100(0000)]。[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "common_0230_rival_09",
      "hash64": "7FE2FB73EF5198BF",
      "text": "對了，校長！\\n我們遇見了天星隊的人。[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "common_0230_head_teacher_07",
      "hash64": "C0DB5622B31FB04E",
      "text": "什麼？\\n是在哪裡遇見的呢！？[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "common_0230_rival_10",
      "hash64": "7FE68873EF54BE2D",
      "text": "在校門的樓梯下面。\\n有個背著伊布包包的學生被找碴……[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "common_0230_head_teacher_08",
      "hash64": "C0DB5122B31FA7CF",
      "text": "這是件大新聞啊……\\n他們現在還在那裡嗎？[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "common_0230_rival_11",
      "hash64": "7FE68773EF54BC7A",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]用實力把他們趕走了。[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "common_0230_head_teacher_09",
      "hash64": "C0DB5022B31FA61C",
      "text": "唉呀，竟然會有這種事。[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "common_0230_head_teacher_10",
      "hash64": "C0D7D322B31C9BDE",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]同學，\\n樂於助人是好事，\\r\\n但[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳剛入學，請別太豪放啊……[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "common_0230_head_teacher_11",
      "hash64": "C0D7D422B31C9D91",
      "text": "妮莫同學也是。\\n這種時候，請找老師過去。[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "common_0230_rival_12",
      "hash64": "7FE68673EF54BAC7",
      "text": "……原來如此。說得也是～[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "common_0230_head_teacher_12",
      "hash64": "C0D7D122B31C9878",
      "text": "伊布的包包……\\n會是牡丹同學嗎？\\r\\n她願意來學校，真是太好了。[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "common_0230_head_teacher_04",
      "hash64": "C0DB5522B31FAE9B",
      "text": "……妮莫同學，\\n妳還是向班導師，吉尼亞老師，\\r\\n報告一聲天星隊的事吧。[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "common_0230_rival_05",
      "hash64": "7FE2FF73EF519F8B",
      "text": "好的！我知道了！[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "common_0230_head_teacher_05",
      "hash64": "C0DB5422B31FACE8",
      "text": "……哎呀，\\n上課時間快到了，\\r\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳們兩位得趕緊往教室去了。[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "common_0230_rival_06",
      "hash64": "7FE30073EF51A13E",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]！\\n我們的教室是１－Ａ。我帶[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳去吧！[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
